    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d329">

                <pb facs="0417" n="333" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg333"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Buchanan to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States,<lb/>on Special Mission</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-12-28"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                28, 1903</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose at the request of his
                    excellency the minister for foreign affairs a certified document showing the
                    action had by certain municipalities of this Republic in the matter of the
                    ratification of the action of the junta of the provisional government in making
                    the treaty with our Government known as the Hay-Varilla treaty. This method of
                    ratification, as the Department knows, is that which has been followed in
                    Colombia during many occasions and especially when any matter of importance has
                    been before the country.</p>
                <p>In this connection I beg to refer the Department to a portion of my note of the
                    27th instant.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Buchanan.</hi></signed></closer>














